{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >El Gran Maja has appeared, and you\u2019re trapped on an island with it. The only way to escape is to take it down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sail through an open world island in your trusty boat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/e596a20eaca9447702a61bac6415364d.poster.avif?t=1773574683\" width=800 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/e596a20eaca9447702a61bac6415364d.webm?t=1773574683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/e596a20eaca9447702a61bac6415364d.mp4?t=1773574683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the islands to uncover why El Gran Maja appeared and discover clues on how to take it down. But be careful El Gran Maja stalks the waters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go Fishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/436bd5992e10fe18ba26ac0bd246ad84.poster.avif?t=1773574683\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/436bd5992e10fe18ba26ac0bd246ad84.webm?t=1773574683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/436bd5992e10fe18ba26ac0bd246ad84.mp4?t=1773574683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the sea and catch over 20 species of fish, but be careful sometimes your catch may shock you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your boat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/c11f8d8c28885dda8997bd64f0259287.poster.avif?t=1773574683\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/c11f8d8c28885dda8997bd64f0259287.webm?t=1773574683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/c11f8d8c28885dda8997bd64f0259287.mp4?t=1773574683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and sell fish, help locals, and complete main quests to earn money and upgrade your boat. Your boat is your lifeline keep it strong.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Maja to Escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/a01e748516d9690bc02aa8d8432b746b.poster.avif?t=1773574683\" width=800 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/a01e748516d9690bc02aa8d8432b746b.webm?t=1773574683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face Maja in the ultimate showdown and escape the island after completing the main quest line. Victory depends on whether you\u2019ve gained enough skill, strength, and firepower to take it down.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758440?t=1773574683","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758440?t=1773574683","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/d05a498b9b21b4471a9455b680813f732136bb41