ng the main quest line. Victory depends on whether you\u2019ve gained enough skill, strength, and firepower to take it down.</p>","developers":["Unreal Fusion Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/5129fbe2a4efc9bc47a911682fed12f188d1f597/header.jpg?t=1773574683","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3758440/59692880/57d21736ed26af361f43d91d94de9ac6b9fbba0b/1773574264/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773574683","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3758440/59692880/57d21736ed26af361f43d91d94de9ac6b9fbba0b/1773574264/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773574683","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3758440/59692880/57d21736ed26af361f43d91d94de9ac6b9fbba0b/1773574264/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773574683","id":257297944,"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257297944/e9f9901ce12998b0730b210e8794963f322c3614/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773574683"}],"name":"Maja Island","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Quad-core Intel or AMD processor<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game includes graphics settings to aid lower end devices.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Unreal Fusion Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror","rating":"16